76520428343798"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","created_at":"2025-07-21T06:09:20.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1947177050470760577"],"id":"1947177050470760577","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":2,"impression_count":47534,"like_count":79,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":10,"retweet_count":1},"text":"中午唠两句。现在这个形势，各位牛马最重要的任务就是一定要保护好你们的老板，千万别让他倒下。因为老板才是你们的奴隶，要赚钱给大家发工资。","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1947177050470760577"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","created_at":"2025-07-20T15:46:21.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1946959876556718560"],"id":"1946959876556718560","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":10,"impression_count":83933,"like_count":156,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":58,"retweet_count":0},"text":"又看了一遍《一路向西》来自慰。贤者时间很好奇当年东莞究竟有多繁华，推特上有人亲身经历过吗？","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1946959876556718560"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","created_at":"2025-07-19T15:16:58.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1946590090270302619"],"id":"1946590090270302619","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":18,"impression_count":98645,"like_count":236,"quote_count":1,"reply_count":22,"retweet_count":1},"text":"我最怀念的还是2022年的推特。那时在推上认识了一位澳洲男生与广州的一位上市公司女高管，他们是通过我认识的。那也是一个台风天，这位澳籍男生回国后在广州约了我们两位女生吃了个饭，饭后那位女高管亲自把澳洲男生送到机场。这段不夹杂任何情色的交往，却是一次最浪漫的邂逅。这在推特真的很宝贵。","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1946590090270302619"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","created_at":"2025-07-19T04:58:24.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1946434425614704764"],"id":"1946434425614704764","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":8,"impression_count":92147,"like_count":199,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":53,"retweet_count":1},"text":"周末来了，除了无套，其他什么都行😜","url":"https://x.com/ciiikick/status/1946434425614704764"},{"author_id":"1534571629061492736","created_at":"2025-07-18T14:23:16.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1946214189070246248"],"id":"1946214189070246248","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":5,"impression_count":77983,"like_count":183,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":34,"retweet_count":2},"text":"我有很好的老粉与炮友了，所以我都不咋